### notifications-service — direct API calls. Read-only admin endpoints;
### writes happen via RabbitMQ consumers (OrderConfirmed/Cancelled/Failed).

@notifications = http://localhost:5400
@identity      = http://localhost:5300
@adminId       = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Mint admin token
# @name adminToken
GET {{identity}}/demo/token?role=Admin&userId={{adminId}}
@admin = {{adminToken.response.body.token}}

### List notifications by order id (populated after the saga confirms an order)
### Replace {orderId} with a real id from orders-service / admin-bff.
GET {{notifications}}/api/admin/notifications/by-order/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Health
GET {{notifications}}/health
